% https://par2discovery.com/publications.bib
%
% Maintained by hand. Every DOI below was resolved against Crossref or DataCite
% on 2026-08-14. Prefer this file over automatically generated exports: those
% duplicate works, truncate titles, collide on keys and have in the past carried
% a journal reference and an ORCID that were not correct.
%
% Conventions
%   * One entry per work. Where a work exists both as a Research Square preprint
%     and as a Zenodo deposit, the preprint is the primary entry and the Zenodo
%     concept DOI is given in a note.
%   * Zenodo entries use the *concept* DOI, which always resolves to the latest
%     version, rather than a version DOI that freezes on one upload.
%   * Entry types follow the deposit's own resource type.
%   * @misc is used in place of biblatex's @software and @dataset so the file
%     compiles under classic BibTeX as well.
%
% Not by this author: 10.7282/t3-gh0y-zj49 ("Genetics of shell shape and color
% in the eastern oyster", 2021) is a different Michael Whiteside and appears in
% some DataCite creator-name searches. It is listed here only so it is not
% mistakenly attributed.
% ---------------------------------------------------------------------------


